; Income and expenses fold into Equity:Earnings:Previous in sorted account
; order, each position adding its cost value, so the earnings positions come
; out in beancount's order: CAD (Expenses:Travel), EUR (Income:Bonus), then
; USD (Income:Dividends at cost, Income:Salary).
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank:USD USD
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank:CAD CAD
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank:EUR EUR
2019-01-01 open Expenses:Travel CAD
2019-01-01 open Income:Bonus EUR
2019-01-01 open Income:Dividends
2019-01-01 open Income:Salary USD

2019-02-01 * "Salary"
  Assets:Bank:USD   1000.00 USD
  Income:Salary    -1000.00 USD

2019-03-01 * "Trip"
  Expenses:Travel    100.00 CAD
  Assets:Bank:CAD   -100.00 CAD

2019-04-01 * "Bonus"
  Assets:Bank:EUR    200.00 EUR
  Income:Bonus      -200.00 EUR

2019-05-01 * "Dividend in kind"
  Assets:Bank:USD     30.00 USD
  Income:Dividends      -3 HOOL {10.00 USD}

2020-02-01 * "After the open date"
  Assets:Bank:USD      1.00 USD
  Income:Salary       -1.00 USD
